(text "A_00 ... A_08: fine bits 0 ... 8\nA_09 ... A_15: seven coarse cells\nB sheets: same network, code 4095-D\n\nEvery box opens a full branch sheet.\nVREF and PGND feed both switches.\nOUT is the weighted resistor terminal.\n\nUpper driver COM follows the switch node.\nLower driver COM follows PGND.\n\nCandidate part numbers are shown\non branch sheets and in bom.csv.\nTBD means not selected for hardware.\n\nCONTROL sheet maps tested HDL\nto all 64 gate commands.\nFPGA package wiring and isolated\nbias converters remain unfinished." (at 609.6000 210.8200 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "b8c01215-d24d-5fb3-a058-244f5cd41c7e"))
(text "OUTPUT AND BENCH INTERFACES / component selection pending" (at 25.4000 518.1600 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a95ee438-af85-5284-8c61-8f3386adf6b3"))
